{"title":"Jacob Jameson","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Jacob Jameson","pagetitle":"Jacob Jameson | Health Policy & Decision Sciences","description":"PhD candidate at Harvard studying health policy, causal inference, and decision sciences.","image":"images/profile.png","body-classes":"home-page","comments":false,"page-layout":"full"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<div class=\"home-layout\">\n\n<section class=\"home-profile\" aria-labelledby=\"home-name\">\n\n<div class=\"home-photo-column\">\n<div class=\"home-photo\">\n<img src=\"images/jj-headshot.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Jacob Jameson\">\n</div>\n\n<nav class=\"home-links\" aria-label=\"Profile and social links\">\n<a href=\"Data/Jameson_vitae.pdf\">CV</a>\n<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=jIrUgQsAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\">Google Scholar</a>\n<a href=\"mailto:jacobjameson@g.harvard.edu\">Email</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacob-jameson\">LinkedIn</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jacobjameson\">GitHub</a>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/JacobCJameson\">Twitter</a>\n<a href=\"https://letterboxd.com/jacobjameson/\">Letterboxd</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"home-bio\">\n\n<header class=\"home-intro\">\n<h1 class=\"home-name\" id=\"home-name\">Jacob Jameson</h1>\n<p class=\"home-role\">PhD candidate at Harvard University</p>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"jm-bar\">\n<span>I am on the academic job market for 2026–2027. Please feel free to <a href=\"mailto:jacobjameson@g.harvard.edu\">get in touch</a> or view my <a href=\"Data/Jameson_vitae.pdf\">CV</a>.</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"home-bio-copy\">\n<p>I am a PhD candidate in Health Policy and Decision Sciences at Harvard University. <a href=\"research.qmd\">My research</a> develops and applies methods in causal inference, decision modeling, and reinforcement learning to generate and synthesize evidence for better decision-making in health and public policy.</p>\n\n<p>I study the impacts of physician behavior, health policies, and personalized medicine. I am an <a href=\"https://hsph.harvard.edu/research/causalab/suicideprevention/\">NIMH T32 Predoctoral Research Fellow in Comparative Effectiveness Research for Suicide Prevention</a> at Brigham and Women’s Hospital and a Research Statistician with the U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs.</p>\n\n<p>I also care deeply about <a href=\"teaching.qmd\">teaching</a>. I have been fortunate to work with students at Harvard, the University of Chicago, and New Haven Public Schools during my time as a Teach For America corps member.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n<aside class=\"home-news-rail\" aria-labelledby=\"news-heading\">\n<h2 class=\"home-news-heading\" id=\"news-heading\">Recent updates</h2>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-07\">July 2026</time>\n<p>Presented at the <a href=\"https://meetings.informs.org/wordpress/healthcare2026/\">INFORMS Healthcare Conference</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-05\">May 2026</time>\n<p>Awarded the <a href=\"https://www.hks.harvard.edu/more/about/leadership-administration/academic-deans-office/slate/research-and-innovation/making/teaching#recipients\">Dean’s Award for Excellence in Student Teaching</a> by Harvard Kennedy School. <a href=\"https://chds.hsph.harvard.edu/jameson-wins-teaching-award-again/\">Read the story</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-05\">May 2026</time>\n<p>Presented at the <a href=\"https://pomsmeetings.org/conf-2026/\">36th Annual POMS Conference</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-05\">May 2026</time>\n<p>Posted a preprint: <a href=\"https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.64898/2026.05.06.26352568v1\">The Effect of Legalizing Online Sports Gambling on Population Mental Health</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<details class=\"home-news-archive\">\n<summary>Earlier updates</summary>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-03\">March 2026</time>\n<p>Selected for the <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/umich.edu/isye-mse-ioe-joint-rising-star/home\">IOE–ISyE–MS&amp;E Rising Stars Workshop</a> and received the People’s Choice Award for my poster.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-03\">March 2026</time>\n<p>Finalist in Harvard’s <a href=\"https://gsas.harvard.edu/academics/writing/three-minute-thesis\">Three Minute Thesis Competition</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2025-09\">September 2025</time>\n<p>Finalist in the <a href=\"https://connect.informs.org/discussion/finalists-of-the-2025-informs-has-best-student-paper-competition\">INFORMS HAS Best Student Paper Competition</a> — <a href=\"Data/INFORMS Award 2025.pdf\">honorable mention</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2025-06\">June 2025</time>\n<p><a href=\"Data/Distinction Award 2025.pdf\">Awarded the Distinction in Student Teaching</a>, Harvard Kennedy School.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2024-05\">May 2024</time>\n<p>Awarded the Distinction in Student Teaching and the Dean’s Award for Excellence in Student Teaching, Harvard Kennedy School.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2024-05\">May 2024</time>\n<p>Awarded an NIMH T32 Predoctoral Fellowship in <a href=\"https://hsph.harvard.edu/research/causalab/suicideprevention/\">Comparative Effectiveness Research for Suicide Risk Prevention</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2024-02\">February 2024</time>\n<p><a href=\"https://chds.hsph.harvard.edu/chds-welcomes-new-educational-innovation-scholar/\">Selected as the Center for Health Decision Science Educational Innovation Scholar</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2024-02\">February 2024</time>\n<p>Received the 2024 Howard Raiffa Award, Harvard Center for Risk Analysis.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2023-09\">September 2023</time>\n<p>Finalist, INFORMS Public Sector OR Best Video Award — <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=do6j8G9qUoM\">Improving Emergency Department Flow</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2023-01\">January 2023</time>\n<p><a href=\"https://chds.hsph.harvard.edu/jameson-receives-raiffa-award/\">Received the 2023 Howard Raiffa Award</a>, Harvard Center for Risk Analysis.</p>\n</article>\n</details>\n\n</aside>\n\n</div>\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<div class=\"home-layout\">\n\n<section class=\"home-profile\" aria-labelledby=\"home-name\">\n\n<div class=\"home-photo-column\">\n<div class=\"home-photo\">\n<img src=\"images/jj-headshot.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Jacob Jameson\">\n</div>\n\n<nav class=\"home-links\" aria-label=\"Profile and social links\">\n<a href=\"Data/Jameson_vitae.pdf\">CV</a>\n<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=jIrUgQsAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\">Google Scholar</a>\n<a href=\"mailto:jacobjameson@g.harvard.edu\">Email</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacob-jameson\">LinkedIn</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jacobjameson\">GitHub</a>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/JacobCJameson\">Twitter</a>\n<a href=\"https://letterboxd.com/jacobjameson/\">Letterboxd</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"home-bio\">\n\n<header class=\"home-intro\">\n<h1 class=\"home-name\" id=\"home-name\">Jacob Jameson</h1>\n<p class=\"home-role\">PhD candidate at Harvard University</p>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"jm-bar\">\n<span>I am on the academic job market for 2026–2027. Please feel free to <a href=\"mailto:jacobjameson@g.harvard.edu\">get in touch</a> or view my <a href=\"Data/Jameson_vitae.pdf\">CV</a>.</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"home-bio-copy\">\n<p>I am a PhD candidate in Health Policy and Decision Sciences at Harvard University. <a href=\"research.qmd\">My research</a> develops and applies methods in causal inference, decision modeling, and reinforcement learning to generate and synthesize evidence for better decision-making in health and public policy.</p>\n\n<p>I study the impacts of physician behavior, health policies, and personalized medicine. I am an <a href=\"https://hsph.harvard.edu/research/causalab/suicideprevention/\">NIMH T32 Predoctoral Research Fellow in Comparative Effectiveness Research for Suicide Prevention</a> at Brigham and Women’s Hospital and a Research Statistician with the U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs.</p>\n\n<p>I also care deeply about <a href=\"teaching.qmd\">teaching</a>. I have been fortunate to work with students at Harvard, the University of Chicago, and New Haven Public Schools during my time as a Teach For America corps member.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n<aside class=\"home-news-rail\" aria-labelledby=\"news-heading\">\n<h2 class=\"home-news-heading\" id=\"news-heading\">Recent updates</h2>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-07\">July 2026</time>\n<p>Presented at the <a href=\"https://meetings.informs.org/wordpress/healthcare2026/\">INFORMS Healthcare Conference</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-05\">May 2026</time>\n<p>Awarded the <a href=\"https://www.hks.harvard.edu/more/about/leadership-administration/academic-deans-office/slate/research-and-innovation/making/teaching#recipients\">Dean’s Award for Excellence in Student Teaching</a> by Harvard Kennedy School. <a href=\"https://chds.hsph.harvard.edu/jameson-wins-teaching-award-again/\">Read the story</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-05\">May 2026</time>\n<p>Presented at the <a href=\"https://pomsmeetings.org/conf-2026/\">36th Annual POMS Conference</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-05\">May 2026</time>\n<p>Posted a preprint: <a href=\"https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.64898/2026.05.06.26352568v1\">The Effect of Legalizing Online Sports Gambling on Population Mental Health</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<details class=\"home-news-archive\">\n<summary>Earlier updates</summary>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-03\">March 2026</time>\n<p>Selected for the <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/umich.edu/isye-mse-ioe-joint-rising-star/home\">IOE–ISyE–MS&amp;E Rising Stars Workshop</a> and received the People’s Choice Award for my poster.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2026-03\">March 2026</time>\n<p>Finalist in Harvard’s <a href=\"https://gsas.harvard.edu/academics/writing/three-minute-thesis\">Three Minute Thesis Competition</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2025-09\">September 2025</time>\n<p>Finalist in the <a href=\"https://connect.informs.org/discussion/finalists-of-the-2025-informs-has-best-student-paper-competition\">INFORMS HAS Best Student Paper Competition</a> — <a href=\"Data/INFORMS Award 2025.pdf\">honorable mention</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2025-06\">June 2025</time>\n<p><a href=\"Data/Distinction Award 2025.pdf\">Awarded the Distinction in Student Teaching</a>, Harvard Kennedy School.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2024-05\">May 2024</time>\n<p>Awarded the Distinction in Student Teaching and the Dean’s Award for Excellence in Student Teaching, Harvard Kennedy School.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2024-05\">May 2024</time>\n<p>Awarded an NIMH T32 Predoctoral Fellowship in <a href=\"https://hsph.harvard.edu/research/causalab/suicideprevention/\">Comparative Effectiveness Research for Suicide Risk Prevention</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2024-02\">February 2024</time>\n<p><a href=\"https://chds.hsph.harvard.edu/chds-welcomes-new-educational-innovation-scholar/\">Selected as the Center for Health Decision Science Educational Innovation Scholar</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2024-02\">February 2024</time>\n<p>Received the 2024 Howard Raiffa Award, Harvard Center for Risk Analysis.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2023-09\">September 2023</time>\n<p>Finalist, INFORMS Public Sector OR Best Video Award — <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=do6j8G9qUoM\">Improving Emergency Department Flow</a>.</p>\n</article>\n\n<article class=\"home-news-entry\">\n<time class=\"home-news-date\" datetime=\"2023-01\">January 2023</time>\n<p><a href=\"https://chds.hsph.harvard.edu/jameson-receives-raiffa-award/\">Received the 2023 Howard Raiffa Award</a>, Harvard Center for Risk Analysis.</p>\n</article>\n</details>\n\n</aside>\n\n</div>\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filt